              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಾಯ್ದೆ — kāyde — \"an act of law\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸರ್ಕಾರ ಹೊಸ ಕಾಯ್ದೆ ತಂದಿತು. sarkāra hosa kāyde tanditu. The government brought in a new act."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A law passed under a name: ಕಾಯ್ದೆ (kāyde). The law in general: ಕಾನೂನು (kānūnu)."
            }
          ]
        },
